  id: act2.doorinthesnow
  displayName: The Door in the Snow
  description: 'Past the Brukam''s bridge the valley climbs into snow, and the portal feels something there: a door that isn''t hers, standing in the open, and someone kneeling at it. Find the door in the snow in Troll Valley.'
  chain: The Hearth and the Door
  journalNotes: A stone door on its own in a snow hollow, in Troll Valley, where the snow falls upward. The man in grey is there. Letting him try it costs a fight; holding the lantern to it ends it.
